,{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-07-25T17:15:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T14:26:17Z","closed_at":"2025-07-30T14:26:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in a1591512f8c3a211b5fc94770fd64e3dbc825630 onward (PR #107782 onward)\n- Not Reproducible in 4.4.1 (but hard to test because it has a separate issue: #108948)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (967e2d499) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10750H CPU @ 2.60GHz (12 threads) - 15.82 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n#107782 introduced a new way of applying the debanding dither: in the `blit.glsl` shader of `renderer_compositor_rd.cpp`.\n\nAs far as I can tell, this new location for applying the viewport debanding filter works well, but to view the change in the editor, the editor must first be restarted. This issue is specific to the editor when HDR 2D is enabled.\n\nIt was difficult to tell whether this was an issue with #107782 before Calinou discovered the source of a longstanding issue in #108950. After applying the fix from #108950, it becomes clear that there is a remaining issue that is specific to #107782.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTo be honest, the easiest way to reproduce this is with a custom editor build that modifies `tonemap.glsl` to the following:\n\n```\n\tif (bool(params.flags & FLAG_USE_8_BIT_DEBANDING)) {\n\t\t// Divide by 255 to align to 8-bit quantization.\n\t\tcolor.rgb += screen_space_dither(gl_FragCoord.xy, 255.0);\n\t\tcolor.r = 1.0;\n\t} else if (bool(params.flags & FLAG_USE_10_BIT_DEBANDING)) {\n\t\t// Divide by 1023 to align to 10-bit quantization.\n\t\tcolor.rgb += screen_space_dither(gl_FragCoord.xy, 1023.0);\n\t\tcolor.r = 1.0;\n\t}\n```\n\nand modify `blit.glsl` to the following:\n\n```\n\t\tif (data.use_debanding) {\n\t\t\tcolor.rgb += screen_space_dither(gl_FragCoord.xy);\n\t\t\tcolor.b = 1.0;\n\t\t}\n```\n\nThis way, any tonemapper-based dithering is easy to see as a red tint and any blit-based debanding is easy to see as a blue tint. When using this approach, you will find that when HDR 2D is enabled, the editor needs to be restarted to match the game's (correct) behaviour.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is a MRP that works well with the above editor changes.\n\n[editor-hdr2d-debanding-needs-restart.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21435110/editor-hdr2d-debanding-needs-restart.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108975/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108975/timeline","performed_via_github_app":